    "title": "ANBERNIC RGCubeXX Handheld Retro Gaming Console \u2013 Dual Joystick, 3.95\" IPS Screen, Linux OS, WiFi, Bluetooth, Dual MicroSD Slots (64GB)",
    "body_html": "<div style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 20px auto; border: 1px solid #e1e4e8; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background-color: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a; color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; text-align: center;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Service &amp; Warranty Policy</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0 0; opacity: 0.8; font-size: 14px;\">Please read carefully before purchasing</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 25px;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; margin-bottom: 25px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n<div style=\"background: #f0f4ff; padding: 12px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 15px;\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z\"></path></svg></div>\n<div>\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 17px; color: #111827;\">7-Days Warranty</h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;\">Anbernic does not provide warranty services in India. If there is any issues within 7 days replacement period, we will provide the replacement.<br><span style=\"color: #6b7280; font-style: italic; font-size: 13px;\">*Requires valid photos/videos of the defect to process the claim.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; margin-bottom: 25px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n<div style=\"background: #ecfdf5; padding: 12px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 15px;\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></div>\n<div>\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 17px; color: #111827;\">Software &amp; SD Card Support</h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;\">Pre-installed games and OS are provided by Anbernic. For software issues, users must re-flash the SD card by downloading the official firmware here: <a href=\"https://win.anbernic.com/download/\" style=\"color: #2563eb; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #2563eb;\" target=\"_blank\">Anbernic Download Center</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start;\">\n<div style=\"background: #fff1f2; padding: 12px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 15px;\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e11d48\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"15\"></line><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"15\"></line></svg></div>\n<div>\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 17px; color: #111827;\">Final Sale Policy</h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;\">We exclusively sell <strong>brand-new products</strong>. As Anbernic does not accept returns, all sales are final. We do not accept returns or offer refunds. Please conduct thorough research before completing your purchase.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 12px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e1e4e8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Authentic Products \u2022 Professional Support</span></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\u00a0</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPspd_wOPOvq_BU_Ox2R69B8iq0ESIdAElcM-5WklaNNtYI7Befmt-FFG1AO4nAhT8RORMcAIjgVnOquVYLvA2dMIXZqZAJ87kcZJs1pNqL7Uey22F7WMQD6v59Zlgxj_uUYErxBBh5hv0npe0BC0HI=w1200-h1200-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMNNYFc1zyqJLstluI8cCwgjn8qpvh98zYw3bq1JCQjPC8VtkwNIii3sqJ1LKoulyBvhy2Hzy7LlQgwVHgrK-QN0HQwobTslYjCuUUT_QfKbGvj8sieBBOTb65OeWQIhQM8NtuduM-yvPCctqFTsUsv=w1200-h1200-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMldXYB99XXsysmWqGDoSXZYECzR0udiVgo72LrdX9jt2AnjhApccaHZRTj5q3NZO84Cxzopugtk7ljfDkwDGQV6Avf2eMF3HxXuybdKd4C_blckm1P3VXI4ZHcBvKa2CR8tK5xZ4JFlEVftXseiCx-=w1200-h1200-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMbABMd_Ec31HJ4-WH9AgjkErxm10uGhWZk5IncjF5xihjSaUaLY_YFDjouJj6pcwyjzNjS9t-Ms0plpMbdwZqqRm9kZrDC7MIWdm1R179o4OoSrPzpcqHuDMHDzJQhJYfGZYfZ28b25nsLrgi_gcpS=w1200-h1200-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPiVZxVAb1MujMzW5AJRvW_zcKN0IiZon9thbkwPNHHYPK-sCfxWyZ9SoNJ5MBnN_apMhWpzJbcHEnsTesuiScPJ-o1EIZSEQMEXj0dwqlP5sGUlqIXmc2F8cHxAzQgGpGYsF7IJxhTPH87QyJe9qU-=w1200-h1200-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNCIoRAhLH26VmVx-nIG4yWHG8kaC1DVzXmBGjrxWGqV66BQyHiyoZw_suIVgnr32TODLc5AeBYtWwmcZufWbCc4uVYHpP5IWH0XL2MiQDfjgMW0XA9xk5R11i8l7O1M-EFDxiHQRTfIImWqvTFK-Tj=w1200-h1200-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNw9KDJlSKelOTpuHYiD51dfSH1WEuAYXXKs-CbGZSCfF6Ckx3-plYws9VZeUkwHMZD38BLpekzay8S3_71jH4-7drD6OH0EXLKjtU0lVayyKBk8RLKiSPCavrEY91JZ4gvyjfKKdb6E_PuKm_F12sa=w1200-h1200-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczP-ypXBkyylVGgu44nCnCWGm2BKlmOaFxohKLY68Daf8Trkj0DvF_CmCsP33_OvaxIPyKaEWTQuChwgiq81BVYxW-lEmpoifh1QjrMSbXxWpeO4B7D-DlzspYOFiw2NBB9PSz6wyV9dKxxip0-eQqcw=w1200-h1200-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"></span></strong></p>\n<!-- \ud83d\udd25 Anbernic RG CubeXX | Card-style Spec Sheet for Shopify -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 20px; border-radius: 14px; background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); font-family: 'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #111827;\">\ud83d\udd25 Anbernic <span style=\"color: #06b6d4;\">RG CubeXX</span>\n</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0; color: #6b7280;\">Square IPS Display \u2022 Linux 64\u2011bit \u2022 H700 Quad\u2011Core \u2022 RGB Lighting</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr)); gap: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #111827; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Colors</strong><br>Black / Gray / White</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Display</strong><br>3.95\" IPS square screen<br>OCA full lamination \u2022 720 \u00d7 720</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #fb923c; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Processor (CPU)</strong><br>H700 Quad-Core ARM Cortex-A53 @ 1.5 GHz</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #f97316; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Graphics (GPU)</strong><br>Dual-Core G31 MP2</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0ea5e9; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Memory (RAM)</strong><br>1 GB LPDDR4</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Storage</strong><br>64 GB TF / MicroSD included<br>Dual TF slots \u2014 expandable up to 512 GB</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #14b8a6; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Operating System</strong><br>Linux 64-bit</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Game Support</strong><br>30+ emulators &amp; ported games<br>User-downloadable formats</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #22c55e; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Wireless</strong><br>Wi\u2011Fi 2.4G / 5G (802.11 a/b/g/n/ac)<br>Bluetooth 4.2</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #84cc16; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Multimedia</strong><br>Video &amp; music player<br>File manager \u2022 TXT e\u2011book reader</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #facc15; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Languages</strong><br>CN / EN / JP / KR / RU / FR / DE / PT / ES</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Speaker</strong><br>High-fidelity stereo speakers</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #eab308; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Battery</strong><br>3800 mAh Li\u2011polymer \u2014 up to 6.5 hours</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #c084fc; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Charging</strong><br>5V / 1.5A \u2014 supports USB\u2011C to USB\u2011C charging</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #a855f7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>RGB Lighting</strong><br>16M-color RGB joystick lighting<br>Multiple effects &amp; brightness control</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #16a34a; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Extra Functions</strong><br>Wireless &amp; wired controllers<br>HD TV output \u2022 Vibration<br>Wi\u2011Fi multiplayer \u2022 Streaming</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #059669; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Accessories</strong><br>USB charging cable \u2022 Color box \u2022 Manual</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #64748b; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Console Dimensions</strong><br>157.2 \u00d7 89.6 \u00d7 17.9 mm</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #334155; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Console Weight</strong><br>246 g</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #16a34a; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Reason to Buy</strong><br><span style=\"color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;\">Unique square display \u2022 RGB gaming vibes \u2022 Strong battery life</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 13px; text-align: center; color: #9ca3af; margin-top: 20px;\">Specifications may vary by configuration and region.</p>\n</div>",
